07], [46.46, -117.2192], [46.8383, -117.0987], [46.7122, -118.1828]], "line": [[46.6281, -117.8214], [46.6281, -117.3999], [46.5861, -118.0021], [46.7542, -118.1225]]}, {"name": "Yakima County", "fips": "53077", "lat": 46.5613, "lng": -120.6953, "bbox": [46.038, -121.525, 47.085, -119.865], "spread": [[47.0326, -121.1931], [46.0899, -120.6953], [46.5613, -119.9485], [46.5089, -121.442]], "line": [[46.9802, -121.1101], [46.7184, -121.3591], [46.5089, -121.442], [46.666, -119.9485]]}], "gaps": {"Columbia": {"kind": "none-found", "reason": "No public Columbia County parcel layer found. Re-searched 2026-10-19 by: ArcGIS Online item search (eight queries incl. Dayton, Public Works), the county GIS page (columbiaco.com/482/GIS) and assessor property search, the county's AGOL org alias (ccpwdgis \u2014 private, no public items), vendor viewer host (columbiawa-mapsifter.publicaccessnow.com \u2014 not reachable even through the relay). A different Columbia County (New York) also answers to the name. Only the licence-restricted statewide mosaic covers it, which is not used."}, "Ferry": {"kind": "login-required", "reason": "The one Ferry County parcel layer on ArcGIS Online (FERRY_COUNTY_PARCEL_LAYER, an individual's account) answers 'Token Required' (499) at service and layer level, so it is not public. The county's viewer is TerraScan MapSifter behind a click-through Disclaimer page (ferrywa-mapsifter.publicaccessnow.com, read through the relay 2026-10-19), which is not replayed. A state parcel record says the county runs an ArcGIS Server but its URL is not published. Only the licence-restricted statewide mosaic covers it, which is not used."}, "Garfield": {"kind": "none-found", "reason": "No public Garfield County parcel layer found. Re-searched 2026-10-19 by: ArcGIS Online item search (six queries: Garfield County parcel, Pomeroy, owner:gmci), the county web map org gmci.maps.arcgis.com (private \u2014 no public items), the Tyler property-search host, the MapSifter viewer host (garfieldwa-mapsifter.publicaccessnow.com, a disclaimer-gated HTML viewer), and the state parcel-producer record (assessor releases CDs on a signed non-commercial declaration). Only the licence-restricted statewide mosaic covers it, which is not used."}, "Okanogan": {"kind": "no-api", "reason": "Okanogan County's parcels are published only in a MapGeo viewer (okanoganwa.mapgeo.io \u2014 a Sanborn-hosted viewer with its own private API, not an ArcGIS REST layer) and as an assessor FTP bulk file. The only ArcGIS Online copy (Okanogan_County_Parcels_view, a project account) answers 'Token Required' (499) and has owner data removed. Re-searched 2026-10-19: AGOL (four queries), county GIS and assessor pages, the Emergency Management org, the MapGeo host through the relay. Calling a viewer's private API would be replaying its key, which this project does not do; the statewide mosaic is licence-restricted and unused."}, "Pacific": {"kind": "no-api", "reason": "Pacific County publishes tax lots only as a downloadable shapefile (tax_lots.zip on the county GIS page) and through TerraScan MapSifter / TaxSifter viewers (pacificwa-mapsifter.publicaccessnow.com, a disclaimer-gated HTML viewer, read through the relay 2026-10-19). Re-searched 2026-10-19: AGOL (four queries \u2014 only user copies of the licence-restricted statewide mosaic and a coastal-study extract), county pages, the state parcel-producer record. No public REST layer exists to wire."}}}